From 72a3e120f57c60c58ed5db97d014feea30614001 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sat, 24 Oct 2026 19:32:08 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] feat: add decision-level fusion, sync audit and v7 protocol
 draft

Adds a no-training IR/RGB decision-fusion tool (train-mean, per-video and
causal online mappings), a label-aware breakdown of replaced frames, a subset
SA bootstrap that reproduces score_runs.py, and a label-free audit of IR/RGB
temporal synchronisation. Label-free pre-registration summaries and a protocol
draft are under artifacts/v7. No label or test data was read.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
